<title>USA: NYMEX COB electricity trades record volume Weds.</title>
<headline>NYMEX COB electricity trades record volume Weds.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The New York Mercantile Exchange (NYMEX) said Thursday that its California Oregon Border (COB) electricity futures traded record volume of 955 contracts on Wednesday.</p>
<p>The volume surpassed a previous record of 923 contracts set March 29, the day the COB electricity contract was launched, NYMEX said in a statement.</p>
<p>--New York Power Desk +1 212 859 1627</p>
